4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr8-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mG612EpTeyIQ7kNvwEA1Kt2&_nc_oc=AdqMgappAg6I8KTxtCu07KMruxV7gEiKln5U-FWOLc5aP98MFs18742LUBuDsxJFQOM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr8-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0dq0ZDS7rgRLupxBOuILclUMmm-DzHi5Y2mwY8_60-gw&oe=69E22FD4"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yrDmqeabjp8Q7kNvwF5GvNc&_nc_oc=Adqm06oD-YV4g44HtnItx1nR4nv2LOs0kbq44uZYbyfSt2ClTu-ZLIKEVeZ56Tjt40Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3niq3cqCtNhwNegpsYsMCcktR27N4gUqaOD2BY7LosDg&oe=69E234B2"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=j8XpEe1wZM8Q7kNvwGh_oBG&_nc_oc=Adoc2kclCcEkw_k8CGwN4oyeCc6QAWq3mGfNzSA3GWgCoXTH26F-tcH5-Txsx_AvYm4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0RQxe-Gyx5Yguq0NPnwlwLzF9HkyHolRcbKXkK45BNbQ&oe=69E24255"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p